# Firespitter Whelp: "Whenever you cast a noncreature or Dragon spell, this creature deals 1 damage to each opponent" (CR 603.2,
# 120.3). Only Bot1's own casts count: Bot2's Mox Ruby (a noncreature spell) leaves Bot2 at 20, and Bot1's Memnite (a creature
# spell that is not a Dragon) does nothing. Bot1's Lightning Bolt (noncreature) triggers it for 1 before the Bolt's 3 (20 to 19
# to 16), and the second Firespitter Whelp (a Dragon creature spell) triggers it for 1 more (16 to 15). It resolves before the
# spell that caused it, so the Whelp spell is still on the stack at 15.

